B.bRx=s(["T\xe8minal la verifye dat ab\xf2nman an (mache san laptop)","Le terminal v\xe9rifie la date d\u2019abonnement (fonctionne sans PC)","The terminal checks the membership date (works without the PC)"],t.s)
B.bCU=s(["Nou mete dat fen ab\xf2nman an sou W2 a. Li ouvri pou moun ki peye, epi li refize moun ki pa peye li menm \u2014 menm si laptop la etenn.","La date de fin est envoy\xe9e au W2. Il ouvre aux membres \xe0 jour et refuse les impay\xe9s lui-m\xeame, m\xeame PC \xe9teint.","The end date is sent to the W2. It opens for paid members and refuses unpaid ones by itself, even with the PC off."],t.s)
B.bqW=s(["Se app la ki ouvri p\xf2t la (apre li fin tcheke peman an)","L\u2019application ouvre la porte (apr\xe8s v\xe9rification du paiement)","The app opens the door (after checking payment)"],t.s)
B.boV=s(["W2 a idantifye moun nan, app la tcheke ab\xf2nman an epi li ouvri. Si app la oswa laptop la f\xe8men, p\xe8sonn pa antre.","Le W2 identifie la personne, l\u2019application v\xe9rifie l\u2019abonnement puis ouvre. Application ferm\xe9e : personne n\u2019entre.","The W2 identifies the person, the app checks the membership then opens. App closed: nobody gets in."],t.s)
B.bHC=s(["Tou de aktive: W2 a mache menm san laptop, epi app la ouvri tou pou moun ki fenk renouvle.","Les deux : le W2 fonctionne sans PC et l\u2019application ouvre aussi pour un membre qui vient de renouveler.","Both: the W2 works without the PC and the app also opens for someone who just renewed."],t.s)
